      "subject": "תחת מה",
      "rationale": "Hibru idiom 'bilong wanem \/ long as bilong wanem' — Tok Pisin 'bilong wanem' i holim gutpela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "עבד \/ עבד",
      "rationale": "Wanpela as עבד i save long ol god bilong narapela lain na bihain i save long ol man bilong narapela ples — pasin bilong skelim wankain, em i pairap long Tok Pisin tu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "lotuim",
      "rationale": "ותעבדו em i 'save long \/ wok long' — 'lotuim' i holim mak bilong save ol god, tasol tok bilong wok i lus."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na bihain, taim yu ol i tok: Bilong wanem Yahwe Elohim bilong yumi mekim ⟨את⟩ olgeta dispela samting long yumi? yu bai tok long ol: Olsem yu ol i lusim ⟨את⟩ mi, na yu ol i lotuim ol god bilong narapela lain long graun bilong yu ol, olsem na yu ol bai i wok long ol man bilong narapela ples long graun i no bilong yu ol.",
